### obtener computadoras
GET http://localhost:3000/api/computer/maintenance


#### obtener una computadora
GET http://localhost:3000/api/computer/maintenance/1


### Cargar nueva computadora
POST http://localhost:3000/api/computer/maintenance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Mantenimiento preventivo",
  "start_date": "01-06-2024",
  "end_date": "10-06-2024",
  "status":"Finalizado"
}


###modificar computadora
put http://localhost:3000/api/computer/maintenance/2
Content-Type: application/json

  {
    "category": "PcGamer",
    "description": "Rtx 308011ti + Ryzen 7 5700x",
    "price": 10200,
    "pcNumber": 3,
    "status": true
  }

###modificar parcialmente computadora  Es innecesaria esta, despues lo saco.
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/computer/maintenance/2
Content-Type: application/json

  {
    "category": "PcGamer",
      "description": "Rtx 3080ti + Ryzen 7 5700x",
      "price": 1000,
      "pcNumber": 21,
      "status": false
  }
#### Eliminar computadora
delete http://localhost:3000/api/computer/maintenance/3

